-- =====================================================================
-- Migration 095 — daily quotes: enough sports quotes for (almost) a year.
-- 337 quotes from athletes and coaches. `source` says where each was said;
-- 'Commonly attributed; not traced to a dated source' marks ones that are widely credited
-- but not pinned to a date, so the coach can check or switch them off on /coach/quotes.
-- Skips any quote whose text is already in the table.
-- =====================================================================
